#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Navy Diver"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Navy Diver" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were a member of a Naval Special Warfare diving group, a skilled soldier"
" adept at underwater infiltration and marine combat.  You were suiting up "
"for a practice dive when the aircraft carrier you were stationed on was "
"somehow flung from the Yellow Sea to who knows where.  You seem to be the "
"only one who survived with your sanity intact, but it's not safe to stay "
"here.  At least you're already dressed to abandon ship."
msgstr ""

