#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Military Recruit"
msgstr "Recrue militaire"

#. ~ Description of profession "Military Recruit" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Joining the military has been your dream for years.  You finally got in, "
"just in time for your training to get interrupted by some sort of national "
"emergency.  As far as you can tell, military command abandoned you in this "
"hellhole when you missed the emergency evac."
msgstr ""
"Rejoindre l'armée était l'un de vos rêves d'enfant. Vous y avez finalement "
"réussi. Cependant votre formation à été interrompue par une sorte d'urgence "
"nationale. De ce que vous savez, vos supérieurs vous a abandonné dans cet "
"enfer lorsque vous avez manqué l'évacuation d'urgence."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
