msgstr "Mécanicien de Combat"

#. ~ Description of profession "Combat Mechanic" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Early in your military career, you were hand-picked for extra training in "
"the mechanic's trade, keeping the armor running.  It's been years since you "
"last touched a rifle, and the dead men are marching again…"
msgstr ""

