#. ~ Description of profession "Motorized Police Officer" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Just a small-town deputy, you got the call and were ready to ride to the "
"rescue.  Soon it was you who needed rescuing, and you had to abandon your "
"motorcycle to escape.  Who's going to respect your authority when the "
"government this badge represents doesn't exist anymore?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Used Car Salesman"
msgstr "Vendeur de voitures d'occasion"

#. ~ Description of profession "Used Car Salesman" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"They said you'd sell your own mother for a dollar.  How dare they!  You've "
"been around the block a few times, and you'd charge way more than a dollar -"
" and get it, too!"
msgstr ""

