#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Demolition Expert"
msgstr "Expert en Démolition"

#. ~ Description of profession "Demolition Expert" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Before this all began, you were having the time of your life at your dream "
"job: blowing stuff up.  The Cataclysm means you're finally allowed to do it "
"full time."
msgstr ""
"Avant que tout ceci commence, vous vous éclatiez comme jamais en faisant "
"votre job de rêve: faire exploser des choses. Le Cataclysme vous donne "
"maintenant l'opportunité de passer à plein temps."

