msgstr "boum."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/talk_vitrified.json
msgid ""
"Sitting among the glass cushions of the couch is the only thing among all "
"the glass which is soft; the limbless, faceless torso of a worn plush doll."
"  It is warm to the touch, but it doesn't feel right to pick it up while "
"it's so damaged."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/talk_vitrified.json
msgid "Reassemble the doll."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_human_sample.json
#: data/json/talk_vitrified.json
msgid "Leave."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/talk_vitrified.json
msgid ""
"Repairing the doll is easier than you thought.  The mismatched parts fit "
"together easily, and soon it is whole again."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/talk_vitrified.json
msgid "You pick up the soft little thing, and feel a strong urge to hug it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
#: data/json/talk_vitrified.json
msgid "black glass bookcase"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass bookcase"
#: data/json/talk_vitrified.json
msgid "This bookcase is missing a book."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/talk_vitrified.json
msgid "This bookshelf is complete, now."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/talk_vitrified.json
msgid ""
"Among the solid wall of glass book spines, there is a single empty space."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/talk_vitrified.json
msgid "Place the glass storybook among the others."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/talk_vitrified.json
msgid ""
"The book slots in among the rest, and you can no longer see the difference."
"  Maybe there isn't any."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/talk_vitrified.json
msgid "You find something new in your inventory."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_vitrified.json
#: data/json/talk_vitrified.json
msgid "shallow black pool"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of terrain "shallow black pool"
#: data/json/talk_vitrified.json
msgid ""
"At first glance, this looks like a rippling pool of black water.  Closer "
"examination reveals it to be fine glass dust, blown in slow waves by the "
"breeze."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/talk_vitrified.json
msgid "The sailboat drifts in slow circles through the sand."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/talk_vitrified.json
msgid ""
"A soft breeze rolls across this pool of sand, rippling it in gentle waves."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/talk_vitrified.json
msgid "Place the glass sailboat in the pool."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/talk_vitrified.json
msgid ""
"The boat would sink immediately in water.  On the denser sand, it finds a "
"balance, and the breeze stirs it to life."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/talk_vitrified.json
msgid "soft glass soil"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of terrain "soft glass soil"
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/talk_vitrified.json
msgid ""
"This little mound of soil is unlike the jagged dirt around it.  It is "
"smooth, welcoming, and pleasant to the touch."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/talk_vitrified.json
msgid "A tiny glass sprout has begun to grow here."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/talk_vitrified.json
msgid "Plant the withered apple in the soil."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/talk_vitrified.json
msgid ""
"The soil yields easily, as if welcoming your contribution.  The rotten shell"
" of the apple crumbles away, and the seeds sparkle as the dirt covers them."
msgstr ""

