msgstr[1] "riz sauvage"
msgstr[2] "riz sauvage"

#. ~ Description of furniture "wild rice"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid ""
"Also called Indian rice, Northern wild rice, or manoomin in Ojibwe, is a "
"species of rice that has been harvested and used by Native American tribes "
"of the northeast for hundreds of years.  It's similar to other types of wild"
" rice, offering a fibre-rich and healthy basis of a meal."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid "short hedge"
msgstr "haie courte"

#. ~ Description of furniture "short hedge"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid "A shrub with small green leaves, trimmed into a squared shape."
msgstr ""
"Une haie basse ayant été taillée jusqu'à atteindre une forme rectangulaire."

