msgstr "tapis forestier"

#. ~ Description of terrain "forest floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "Covered in twigs and lots of brown, decaying leaves."
msgstr "Une section de sol couvert de mousses, brindilles et feuilles mortes."

