msgid ""
"A .300 AAC Blackout round with a 125gr bullet.  .300 BLK is an intermediate "
"cartridge necked up from 5.56x45mm, designed to achieve similar ballistics "
"to 7.62x39mm.  Someone was down on their luck when they hand-reloaded this "
"one - it's filled with black powder instead of smokeless powder.  Expect "
"lower velocity, muzzle smoke, and a dirtier barrel if you shoot it."
msgstr ""

