msgid_plural "albino mink coats"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of variant "albino mink coat" of item "fur coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"Even more prized than regular mink jackets, this coat is exclusively "
"composed of plush white fur with no markings or color in its undercoat.  "
"Extremely warm and equipped with dual pockets, this expensive fashion "
"statement would certainly turn some heads if anyone left alive could still "
"care about aesthetics."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Variant name of item "fur coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
