msgstr[1] "manteaux en zibeline"
msgstr[2] "manteaux en zibeline"

#. ~ Description of variant "sable coat" of item "fur coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"The favorite coat of old European royalty, this extravagant jacket of "
"Russian sable is composed of stitched panels of cinnamon brown fur with a "
"pale yellow undercoat and silver tips.  Possessing a tall collar and flaring"
" hips that just might require you to walk sideways through narrower door "
"frames, the coat is impractical, swelteringly warm, and incredibly stylish."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Variant name of item "fur coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
