#. ~ roughly 0.25mm per sheet of canvas making this a 30-layer jack, sheets
#. are 1x2 feet. 105 sheets for the vest and 36 sheets for the arms (141
#. total).
#. ~ Description of "canvas gambeson"
#: data/json/items/armor/gambesons.json
msgid ""
"A thick cloth greatcoat intended to be worn as standalone armor, as it's a "
"little too thick to comfortably add chainmail or a cuirass on top.  Made of "
"thirty layers of tough canvas, this will protect you from almost everything,"
" but it's very heavy and warm.  The sleeves are a bit thinner for "
"flexibility and it drapes below your legs, providing additional protection "
"there."
msgstr ""

