msgstr[1] "anneaux de pureté"
msgstr[2] "anneaux de pureté"

#. ~ Description of "purity ring"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"Also known as a promise ring, this ring is worn as a sign of chastity.  This"
