#. ~ Description of variant "British-khaki pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"While these pants might not be English, their color certainly is.  More "
"specifically, these comfortable trousers are a shade of British-khaki, a "
"type of brownish-yellow hue developed by the empire's military for use in "
"service uniforms."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
