msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of variant "tan-khaki pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A pair of casual, tan-hued pants with a slight yellowish overtone, intended "
"to contrast with one's skin color."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Variant name of item "pants"
