msgstr[2] "copies de Sunvault"

#. ~ Description of "Sunvault: Stories of Solarpunk & Eco-Speculation"
#: data/json/items/book/anthology.json
msgid ""
"Sunvault is the first English-language anthology to broadly collect "
"solarpunk short fiction, artwork, and poetry.  A new genre for the 21st "
"Century, solarpunk is a revolution against despair.  Focusing on solutions "
"to environmental disasters, solarpunk envisions a future of green, "
"sustainable energy used by societies that value inclusiveness, cooperation, "
"and personal freedom.  Published by Upper Rubber Boot Books."
msgstr ""

