msgstr[1] "guides touristiques"
msgstr[2] "guides touristiques"

#. ~ Description of "tourist guide"
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"This is glossy printed pamphlet for tourists that details local hotels and "
"attractions."
msgstr ""
"Un dépliant pour les touristes, indiquant les hôtels locaux et les "
"attractions."

#. ~ "message" action message of item "tourist guide"
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid "You add roads and tourist attractions to your map."
msgstr ""
"Vous ajoutez des routes et des attractions touristiques à votre carte."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid "restaurant guide"
msgid_plural "restaurant guides"
msgstr[0] "guide des restaurants"
msgstr[1] "guides des restaurants"
msgstr[2] "guides des restaurants"

#. ~ Description of "restaurant guide"
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"This is glossy printed pamphlet that details dining establishments in the "
"local area.  Printed by the Chamber of Commerce, it lists the addresses of "
"all the best diners and bars.  Using it will add points of interest to your "
"map."
msgstr ""
"Un dépliant qui indique les établissements culinaires de la région. Imprimé "
"par la chambre du commerce, il liste les adresses des meilleurs restaurants "
"et bars. L'utiliser vous révèlera ces points d'intérêts sur votre carte."

#. ~ "message" action message of item "restaurant guide"
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid "You add roads and restaurants to your map."
msgstr "Vous ajoutez des routes et des restaurants à votre carte."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid "satellite map"
msgid_plural "satellite maps"
msgstr[0] "carte satellite"
msgstr[1] "cartes satellite"
msgstr[2] "cartes satellite"

#. ~ Description of "satellite map"
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"A printed satellite map of the local area.  Due to it's low quality and lack"
" of map legend, you are unable to recognise most buildings.  Using it will "
"add terrain and roads to your map."
msgstr ""
"Un carte satellite imprimée des environs. La basse qualité des images et le "
"manque de légende rends l'identification de la plupart des bâtiments "
"impossible, mais utiliser cet objet ajoutera le terrain et les routes "
"locales à votre carte."

#. ~ "message" action message of item "satellite map"
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid "You add terrain and roads to your map."
msgstr "Vous ajoutez le terrain et les routes à votre carte."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid "urban explorer's map"
msgid_plural "urban explorer's maps"
msgstr[0] "carte d'explorateur urbain"
msgstr[1] "cartes d'explorateur urbain"
msgstr[2] "cartes d'explorateur urbain"

#. ~ Description of "urban explorer's map"
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid ""
"A printout of a local road map, with several buildings circled in red.  "
"Using it will add roads and abandoned buildings to your map."
msgstr ""
"Une carte imprimée des environs avec certains bâtiments entourés en rouge. "
"Utiliser cet objet ajoutera les routes et bâtiments abandonnés locaux à "
"votre carte."

#. ~ "message" action message of item "urban explorer's map"
#: data/json/items/book/maps.json
msgid "You add roads and abandoned buildings to your map."
msgstr "Vous ajoutez les routes et les bâtiments abandonnés à votre carte."

