"Concentrated cannabis extract, commonly known as dabs.  This particular "
"style of concentrate is yellow and waxy at room temperature.  Normal "
"cannabis contains around 20% THC; this wax should be around 45% THC."
msgstr ""

#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "cannabis wax"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You take a dab of wax.  *cough cough* Good stuff!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "cannabis distillate"
msgid_plural "cannabis distillate"
msgstr[0] "distillat de cannabis"
msgstr[1] "distillat de cannabis"
msgstr[2] "distillat de cannabis"

#. ~ Description of "cannabis distillate"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Concentrated cannabis extract.  This style of extract goes through the most "
"processing, eliminating most if not all harmful ingredients.  Normal "
"cannabis contains around 20% THC; this distillate should be around 88% THC."
"  Can be smoked using a refillable electronic cigarette."
msgstr ""
"De l'extrait de cannabis concentré. Ce type d'extrait passe à travers le "
"plus de raffinement et élimine entre la majorité et la totalité des "
"ingrédients indésirables de la matière première. Le cannabis normal à dans "
"les environs de 20% de teneur en THC; ce distillat devrait avoir une teneur "
"d'autour de 88% et peut être fumé avec une cigarette électronique "
"rechargeable."

#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "cannabis distillate"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You take a dab of distillate.  Sooooo smooth…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "electronic cigarette"
msgid_plural "electronic cigarettes"
msgstr[0] "cigarette électrique"
msgstr[1] "cigarettes électriques"
msgstr[2] "cigarettes électriques"

#. ~ Description of "electronic cigarette"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"This battery-operated device vaporizes a liquid that contains flavorings and"
" nicotine.  A less harmful alternative to traditional cigarettes, but it's "
"still addictive.  It can't be reused once it's empty."
msgstr ""
"Cet appareil a pile vaporise un liquide contenant des arômes et de la "
"nicotine.  Un alternative moins nocive aux cigarette traditionnelles mais "
"toujours addictive. Il peut être réutilisé une fois vide."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "saline eye drop"
msgid_plural "saline eye drops"
msgstr[0] "gouttes oculaires"
msgstr[1] "gouttes oculaires"
msgstr[2] "gouttes oculaires"

#. ~ Description of "saline eye drop"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Sterile saline eye drops.  Can be used to treat dry eyes, or to wash out "
"contaminants."
msgstr ""
"Une solution saline stérile pour les yeux. Peux traiter les yeux secs, ou "
"pour les nettoyer."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
msgid "flu shot"
msgid_plural "flu shots"
msgstr[0] "vaccin contre la grippe"
msgstr[1] "vaccins contre la grippe"
msgstr[2] "vaccins contre la grippe"

#. ~ Description of "flu shot"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A pharmaceutical flu shot designed for mass vaccinations, still in its "
"packaging.  Purported to provide immunity to influenza, for the flu season "
"for which it was developed."
msgstr ""
"Un vaccin pharmaceutique contre la grippe, conçu pour des campagnes de "
"vaccination de masse; il est encore dans son emballage et est censé fournir "
"une immunité aux souches de grippe prédominantes pour la saison à laquelle "
"il était destiné, espérons qu'il soit toujours efficace."

#. ~ Tougher to market a hand rolled, could be anything in there.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "hand-rolled cigarette"
msgid_plural "hand-rolled cigarettes"
msgstr[0] "cigarette roulée"
msgstr[1] "cigarettes roulées"
msgstr[2] "cigarettes roulées"

#. ~ Tougher to market a hand rolled, could be anything in there.
#. ~ Description of "hand-rolled cigarette"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A roll-your-own cigarette.  Stimulates mental acuity and reduces appetite.  "
"Despite being hand crafted, it's still highly addictive and hazardous to "
"health."
msgstr ""
"Un cigarette roulée à la main avec du tabac et une feuille de papier. "
"Stimule l'acuité mentale et réduit l'appétit. Malgré le fait qu'elle soit "
"fabriquée à la main, elle reste hautement addictive et dangereuse pour la "
"santé."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "heroin"
msgid_plural "heroin"
msgstr[0] "héroïne"
msgstr[1] "héroïne"
msgstr[2] "héroïne"

#. ~ Description of "heroin"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"An extremely strong opioid narcotic derived from morphine.  Incredibly "
"addictive, the risk of overdose is extreme, and the drug is contraindicated "
"for nearly all medical purposes."
msgstr ""
"Un dérivé de la morphine extrêmement puissant. Incroyablement addictif. Les "
"risques d'overdose sont grands, et cette drogue est contre-indiquée dans "
"pratiquement tout les traitements médicaux."

#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "heroin"
#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "morphine"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You shoot up."
msgstr "Vous vous shootez."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "potassium iodide tablet"
msgid_plural "potassium iodide tablets"
msgstr[0] "tablette d'iodure de potassium"
msgstr[1] "tablettes d'iodure de potassium"
msgstr[2] "tablettes d'iodure de potassium"

#. ~ Description of "potassium iodide tablet"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A potassium iodide tablet.  If taken prior to exposure, they help to "
"mitigate injury caused by radiation absorption."
msgstr ""
"Des tablettes d'iodure de potassium. Prises avant exposition, elles aident à"
" limiter les dégâts causés par l'exposition aux rayonnements."

#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "potassium iodide tablet"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You take some potassium iodide."
msgstr "Vous prenez de l'iodure de potassium"

#. ~ Description of "joint"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Marijuana, cannabis, pot.  Whatever you want to call it, it's rolled up in a"
" piece of paper and ready for smokin'."
msgstr ""
"Marijuana, cannabis, peu importe comment on l'appelle, c'est roulé dans une "
"feuille de papier et prêt à être fumé."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "pink tab"
msgid_plural "pink tabs"
msgstr[0] "pillule rose"
msgstr[1] "pillules roses"
msgstr[2] "pillules roses"

#. ~ Description of "pink tab"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A tiny pink tabs resembling a postage stamp, dosed with some sort of drug.  "
"Really only useful for entertainment.  Will cause hallucinations."
msgstr ""
"Une petite tablette rose ressemblant à une timbre-poste dosée avec une sorte"
" de drogue et utile uniquement si vous voulez vous amuser et causera des "
"hallucinations sévères."

#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "pink tab"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You eat the pink tablet."
msgstr "Vous mangez la pillule rose."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "low-grade methamphetamine"
msgid_plural "low-grade methamphetamine"
msgstr[0] "méthamphétamine de bas grade"
msgstr[1] "méthamphétamine de bas grade"
msgstr[2] "méthamphétamine de bas grade"

#. ~ Description of "low-grade methamphetamine"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A profoundly addictive and powerful stimulant.  While extremely effective at"
" enhancing alertness, it is hazardous to health and the risk of an adverse "
"reaction is great."
msgstr ""
"Un stimulant puissant et très addictif. Même si c'est très efficace pour "
"rester alerte, ses effets néfastes sur la santé et les risques d'effets "
"indésirables sont grands."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "high-grade methamphetamine"
msgid_plural "high-grade methamphetamine"
msgstr[0] "méthamphétamine de haute qualité"
msgstr[1] "méthamphétamine de haute qualité"
msgstr[2] "méthamphétamine de haute qualité"

#. ~ Description of "high-grade methamphetamine"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A profoundly addictive and powerful stimulant.  While extremely effective at"
" enhancing alertness, it is hazardous to health and the risk of an adverse "
"reaction is great.  This one could have only been made by a great chemist."
msgstr ""
"Un stimulant profondément addictif et stimulant. Extrêmement efficace à "
"garder votre corps alerte et éveillé, les effets secondaires et le risque "
"d'une réaction néfaste grave sont considérables. Cette dose est d'une "
"qualité qui ne pourrait être atteinte que par un chimiste connaissant ses "
"recettes sur le bout des doigts."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "morphine"
msgid_plural "morphines"
msgstr[0] "morphine"
msgstr[1] "morphine"
msgstr[2] "morphine"

#. ~ Description of "morphine"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A very strong, naturally-occurring narcotic used to treat intense pain in "
"hospital settings.  You'll need a syringe to inject it, and it's very "
"addictive, so be careful."
msgstr ""
"Un narcotique naturel très puissant utilisé pour soulager les grandes "
"douleurs dans les hôpitaux et très addictif dans le cadre d'une consommation"
" récréative. Vous aurez besoin d'une seringue pour l'injecter, et essayez de"
" ne pas surdoser."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "wintergreen oil"
msgid_plural "wintergreen oils"
msgstr[0] "huile de gaulthérie"
msgstr[1] "huile de gaulthérie"
msgstr[2] "huile de gaulthérie"

#. ~ Description of "wintergreen oil"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"An ointment infused with wintergreen oil.  Has mild antiseptic properties, "
"and can ease the pain caused by wounds."
msgstr ""
"Un onguent infusé d'huile de gaulthérie possédant des propriétés "
"antiseptiques et capable de soulager la douleur causée par une blessure."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "mugwort oil"
msgid_plural "mugwort oils"
msgstr[0] "huile d'armoise"
msgstr[1] "huile d'armoise"
msgstr[2] "huile d'armoise"

#. ~ Description of "mugwort oil"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Some essential oil made from mugwort, which may kill parasites when "
"ingested.  Consume it with water!"
msgstr ""
"Une huile essentielle d'armoise, qui peut tuer les parasites si on la boit. "
"A consomer avec de l'eau!"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "nicotine gum"
msgid_plural "nicotine gums"
msgstr[0] "gomme à mâcher à la nicotine"
msgstr[1] "gommes à mâcher à la nicotine"
msgstr[2] "gommes à mâcher à la nicotine"

#. ~ Description of "nicotine gum"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Mint flavored sugar-free nicotine chewing gum.  For smokers who desire to "
"quit."
msgstr ""
"Un chewing gum parfumé à la menthe contenant une dose de nicotine conçu pour"
" les fumeurs désirant arrêter."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "cough syrup"
msgid_plural "cough syrup"
msgstr[0] "sirop pour la toux"
msgstr[1] "sirops pour la toux"
msgstr[2] "sirops pour la toux"

#. ~ Description of "cough syrup"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Nighttime cold and flu medication.  Useful when trying to sleep with a head "
"full of virions.  Will cause drowsiness."
msgstr ""
"Un médicament à prendre la nuit, destiné à lutter contre les rhumes et la "
"grippe. Il est utile lorsque l'on essaie de dormir la tête emplie de "
"virions; il provoque des somnolences."

#. ~ Fairly controlled substance as they go.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "oxycodone"
msgid_plural "oxycodones"
msgstr[0] "oxycodone"
msgstr[1] "oxycodone"
msgstr[2] "oxycodone"

#. ~ Fairly controlled substance as they go.
#. ~ Description of "oxycodone"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A strong semi-synthetic narcotic used in the treatment of intense pain.  "
"Highly addictive."
msgstr ""
"Un narcotique puissant semi-synthétique, utilisé en traitement contre les "
"douleurs sévères. Hautement addictif."

#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "oxycodone"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You take some oxycodone."
msgstr "Vous prenez de l'oxycodone."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "sleeping pill"
msgid_plural "sleeping pill"
msgstr[0] "somnifère"
msgstr[1] "somnifères"
msgstr[2] "somnifères"

#. ~ Description of "sleeping pill"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A habit-forming tranquilizer with a variety of psychoactive side effects.  "
"Used in the treatment of insomnia."
msgstr ""
"Un tranquillisant addictif avec une variété d'effets secondaires "
"psychoactifs pouvant traiter l'insomnie."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "poppy painkiller"
msgid_plural "poppy painkillers"
msgstr[0] "antidouleur au pavot"
msgstr[1] "antidouleurs au pavot"
msgstr[2] "antidouleurs au pavot"

#. ~ Description of "poppy painkiller"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A potent opioid palliative produced by the refining of the mutated poppy.  "
"Notably devoid of euphoric or sedative effects, but as an opiate it can "
"still be addictive."
msgstr ""
"Un opioïde palliatif puissant fabriqué par le raffinement d'un coquelicot "
"mutant. Notable pour son manque d'effets euphoriques et sédatifs, mais "
"toujours addictif."

#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "poppy painkiller"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You take some poppy painkiller."
msgstr "Vous prenez des antidouleurs au pavot."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "poppy sleep"
msgid_plural "poppy sleeps"
msgstr[0] "somnifère au pavot"
msgstr[1] "somnifères au pavot"
msgstr[2] "somnifères au pavot"

#. ~ Description of "poppy sleep"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A potent sleep aid extracted from mutated poppy seeds.  Effective, but as an"
" opiate it can be addictive."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "poppy cough syrup"
msgid_plural "poppy cough syrup"
msgstr[0] "sirop de pavot pour la toux"
msgstr[1] "sirops de pavot pour la toux"
msgstr[2] "sirops de pavot pour la toux"

#. ~ Description of "poppy cough syrup"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Cough syrup made from mutated poppy.  Will make you sleepy."
msgstr ""
"Du sirop pour la toux fabriqué à partir de pavot muté. Provoque un effet de "
"somnolence."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "injectable prophylactic antivenom"
msgid_plural "injectable prophylactic antivenom"
msgstr[0] "antivenin prophylactique injectable"
msgstr[1] "antivenin prophylactique injectable"
msgstr[2] "antivenin prophylactique injectable"

#. ~ Description of "injectable prophylactic antivenom"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"An experimental, cutting-edge antivenom in the form of a small amber vial, "
"designed to be injected a few hours before venom exposure.  It was developed"
" in top secret by the military in response to increasing biological/chemical"
" warfare."
msgstr ""

#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "injectable prophylactic
#. antivenom"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"You inject a vial of prophylactic antivenom into your arm.  You feel a bit "
"queasy."
msgstr ""
"Vous injectez le contenu d'un flacon d'antivenin prophylactique dans votre "
"bras. Vous sentez une nausée monter."

#. ~ Don't have a cite for this one.
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "antidepressant"
msgid_plural "antidepressant"
msgstr[0] "antidépresseur"
msgstr[1] "antidépresseur"
msgstr[2] "antidépresseur"

#. ~ Don't have a cite for this one.
#. ~ Description of "antidepressant"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A common and popular antidepressant.  It will elevate mood, and can "
"profoundly alter the effects of other drugs.  It is only rarely habit-"
"forming, though adverse reactions are not uncommon."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "Prussian blue tablet"
msgid_plural "Prussian blue tablets"
msgstr[0] "tablette de bleu de Prusse"
msgstr[1] "tablettes de bleu de Prusse"
msgstr[2] "tablettes de bleu de Prusse"

#. ~ Description of "Prussian blue tablet"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A tablet containing oxidized ferrous ferrocyanide salts.  Capable of purging"
" nuclear contaminants from the body if taken after radiation exposure."
msgstr ""

#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "Prussian blue tablet"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You take some Prussian blue."
msgstr "Vous prenez du bleu de Prusse."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "hemostatic powder"
msgid_plural "hemostatic powder"
msgstr[0] "poudre hémostatique"
msgstr[1] "poudre hémostatique"
msgstr[2] "poudre hémostatique"

#. ~ Description of "hemostatic powder"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A powdered antihemorrhagic compound that reacts with blood to immediately "
"form a gel-like substance that stops bleeding."
msgstr "Une poudre qui réagit avec le sang pour stopper les hémorragies."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "saline solution"
msgid_plural "saline solutions"
msgstr[0] "solution saline"
msgstr[1] "solutions saline"
msgstr[2] "solutions saline"

#. ~ Description of "saline solution"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A solution of sterilized water and salt for intravenous infusion or washing "
"contaminants from one's eyes."
msgstr ""
"Une solution d'eau stérilisée salée, pour des infusions intraveineuses ou "
"pour nettoyer les yeux."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "antipsychotic"
msgid_plural "antipsychotic"
msgstr[0] "antipsychotique"
msgstr[1] "antipsychotiques"
msgstr[2] "antipsychotiques"

#. ~ Description of "antipsychotic"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Anti-psychotic medication.  Used to stabilize brain chemistry, it can arrest"
" hallucinations and other symptoms of psychosis.  Carries a sedative effect."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "thyme oil"
msgid_plural "thyme oils"
msgstr[0] "huile de thym"
msgstr[1] "huiles de thym"
msgstr[2] "huiles de thym"

#. ~ Description of "thyme oil"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Some essential oil made from thyme, which can act as a mildly irritating "
"antiseptic."
msgstr ""
"Une huile essentielle faite à partir de thym, qui peut servir d'antiseptique"
" tout en étant légèrement irritant."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "rolling tobacco"
msgid_plural "rolling tobaccos"
msgstr[0] "tabac à rouler"
msgstr[1] "tabac à rouler"
msgstr[2] "tabac à rouler"

#. ~ Description of "rolling tobacco"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Loose, fine-cut tobacco leaves.  Popular in Europe and among hipsters.  Highly addictive and hazardous to health.\n"
"Can either be rolled into a cigarette with some rolling papers or smoked through a pipe."
msgstr ""
"Des feuilles fines de tabac, hachées. Populaire en Europe et parmi les hipsters. Hautement addictif, c'est un danger pour la santé.\n"
"On peut les rouler dans une feuille pour en faire une cigarette ou les fumer dans une pipe."

#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "rolling tobacco"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You smoke some tobacco."
msgstr "Vous fumez un peu de tabac."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "tramadol"
msgid_plural "tramadols"
msgstr[0] "tramadol"
msgstr[1] "tramadol"
msgstr[2] "tramadol"

#. ~ Description of "tramadol"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A painkiller used to manage moderate pain.  The effects last for several "
"hours, but are relatively subdued for an opioid."
msgstr ""
"Un antalgique utilisé pour atténuer les douleurs modérées. Les effets durent"
" plusieurs heures mais sont relativement diffus pour un opioïde."

#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "tramadol"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "You take some tramadol."
msgstr "Vous prenez du tramadol."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "multivitamin"
msgid_plural "multivitamins"
msgstr[0] "comprimé multivitaminé"
msgstr[1] "comprimés multivitaminés"
msgstr[2] "comprimés multivitaminés"

#. ~ Description of "multivitamin"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Essential dietary nutrients conveniently packaged in pill form.  An option "
"of last resort when a balanced diet is not possible.  Excess use can cause "
"hypervitaminosis."
msgstr ""
"Nutriments diététiques commodément conditionnés sous forme de pilule. Une "
"option de dernier recours quand un régime alimentaire équilibré n'est pas "
"possible. Une consommation excessive peut entraîner une hypervitaminose."

#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "multivitamin"
#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "calcium tablet"
#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "bone meal tablet"
#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "flavored bone meal tablet"
#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "wyld candy"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/drugs.json
#, c-format
msgid "You take the %s."
msgstr "Vous prenez %s."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "calcium tablet"
msgid_plural "calcium tablets"
msgstr[0] "tablette de calcium"
msgstr[1] "tablettes de calcium"
msgstr[2] "tablettes de calcium"

#. ~ Description of "calcium tablet"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A white calcium tablet.  Widely used by elderly people with osteoporosis as "
"a method to supplement calcium before the apocalypse."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "bone meal tablet"
msgid_plural "bone meal tablets"
msgstr[0] "tablette de farine d'os"
msgstr[1] "tablettes de farine d'os"
msgstr[2] "tablettes de farine d'os"

#. ~ Description of "bone meal tablet"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A homemade calcium supplement made out of bone meal.  Tastes horrible and is"
" hard to swallow but it does its job."
msgstr ""
"Un supplément de calcium fait maison à partir de farine d'os. Le goût est "
"horrible et les pilules difficiles à avaler, mais ceci peut vous aider à "
"lutter contre une carence."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "flavored bone meal tablet"
msgid_plural "flavored bone meal tablets"
msgstr[0] "tablette de farine d'os aromatisée"
msgstr[1] "tablettes de farine d'os aromatisées"
msgstr[2] "tablettes de farine d'os aromatisées"

#. ~ Description of "flavored bone meal tablet"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"A homemade calcium supplement made out of bone meal.  Due to some sweeteners"
" mixed in to counteract the powdery texture and the taste of ash, it's "
"almost as palatable as the pre-Cataclysm tablets."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid "gummy vitamin"
msgid_plural "gummy vitamins"
