#. ~ Description of gun "Ruger LCP"
#: data/json/items/gun/380.json
msgid ""
"One of the best-selling modern day 'pocket pistols', the LCP is an "
"affordable, polymer framed pistol chambered in .380 ACP.  Despite the "
