#. ~ Description of variant "M1911 pistol" of gun "M45A1"
#: data/json/items/gun/45.json
msgid ""
"The M45A1 supplanted earlier M45 MEUSOC pistols in use by Force Recon "
"elements of Marine Expeditionary Units.  Where the original M45 pistols were"
" gutted M1911A1s hand-fitted by USMC armorers, the updated M45A1s are hardly"
" different from any other commercial 1911 design, save for their dual recoil"
" springs.  Most were replaced in 2016 with Glock 19s due to logistics "
"issues."
msgstr ""

