msgstr[1] "harnais et jougs renforcés"
msgstr[2] "harnais et jougs renforcés"

#. ~ calculating weight: yoke_harness (1000g) + frame (20 000g) + scrap
#. (50g)x35 OR steel_lump(1000g)x5 + pipe(1250g)x2 + chain(3628)x2. Total 1:
#. 32506g. Total 2: 35756g. With rounding and fudge factor: 35000g. Previus
#. eyeballed guess before doing any of this math was 30000g.
#. ~ Description of "reinforced yoke and harness"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/animals.json
msgid ""
"Heavy steel beams and harness to attach a sufficiently large creature to a "
"wheeled vehicle, allowing them to pull it along, reinforced to withstand the"
" rigors of the apocalypse and ill-advised off-roading.  You would still need"
" separate armor for said creature to wear."
msgstr ""
"De lourdes poutres en acier et un harnais à attacher à une créature "
"domestiquée assez large pour tirer un véhicule à roues et assez renforcé "
"pour subir les rigeurs de l'apocalyspe et du hors-piste déconseillé. "
"L'animal tirant le véhicule aura tout de même besoin d'armure pour être "
"protégé."

