#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"Judging by looks, this poor individual was probably an archeologist in their"
" former life.  Rabid and bloodshot, they now seem intent to make you a part "
"of their collection as they come at you with a shovel in hand."
msgstr ""

