msgstr[1] "zombies blindés"
msgstr[2] "zombies blindés"

#. ~ Description of monster "armored zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid ""
"Despite being encased in a what was once a nigh-impenetrable combat "
"exoskeleton, something still managed to kill this soldier."
msgstr ""
"Malgré le fait que ce soldat était encastré dans une exosquelette blindé de "
"combat quasiment impénétrable, quelque chose est arrivé à percer ses "
"défenses et le zombifier."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid "zombie bio-operator"
msgid_plural "zombie bio-operators"
msgstr[0] "soldat bionique zombifié"
msgstr[1] "soldats bioniques zombifiés"
msgstr[2] "soldats bioniques zombifiés"

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie bio-operator"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid ""
"This armored soldier zombie appears to have been some sort of special forces"
" agent.  Its malfunctioning equipment sends out occasional showers of "
"sparks."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid "elite zombie bio-operator"
msgid_plural "elite zombie bio-operators"
msgstr[0] "soldat bionique zombifié d'élite"
msgstr[1] "soldats bioniques zombifiés d'élite"
msgstr[2] "soldats bioniques zombifiés d'élite"

#. ~ Description of monster "elite zombie bio-operator"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_soldiers.json
msgid ""
"Once a highly-trained soldier, this zombie is still equipped with heavy "
"military gear and dangerous physical abilities.  Its malfunctioning "
"equipment sends out occasional showers of sparks."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/zed_survivor.json
msgid "survivor zombie"
msgid_plural "survivor zombies"
msgstr[0] "survivant zombifié"
msgstr[1] "survivants zombifiés"
msgstr[2] "survivants zombifiés"

#. ~ Description of monster "survivor zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_survivor.json
msgid ""
"Still wearing the tattered remnants of improvised armor and weaponry, it is "
"plain to see that this zombie was once a survivor like you."
msgstr ""
"Portant toujours les résidus d'armures et d'armes improvisés, on voit bien "
"que ce zombie était un survivant comme vous."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/zed_survivor.json
msgid "paramilitary zombie"
msgid_plural "paramilitary zombies"
msgstr[0] "paramilitaire zombifié"
msgstr[1] "paramilitaires zombifiészombies paramilitaires"
msgstr[2] "paramilitaires zombifiés"

#. ~ Description of monster "paramilitary zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_survivor.json
msgid ""
"Wearing military surplus gear including an armored vest with patches of "
"local militias, cartoon women, obscene statements, or local political "
"groups.  This person definitely thought they were ready for the apocalypse."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/zed_survivor.json
msgid "veteran survivor zombie"
msgid_plural "veteran survivor zombies"
msgstr[0] "survivant vétéran zombifié"
msgstr[1] "survivants vétérans zombifiés"
msgstr[2] "survivants vétérans zombifiés"

#. ~ Description of monster "veteran survivor zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_survivor.json
msgid ""
"This zombie once was a survivor like you, and a pretty good one at that.  "
"Unfortunately they didn't make it, despite the custom-made, heavy armor "
"pieces they wear and the gear that they are still lugging around."
msgstr ""

