#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/mutations/changing_eocs.json
msgid "<CHANGING_FAILED>"
msgstr "<CHANGING_FAILED>"

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/mutations/changing_eocs.json
msgid "<CHANGING_SUCCESS>"
msgstr "<CHANGING_SUCCESS>"

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/mutations/changing_eocs.json
msgid "<CHANGING_ENDS>"
msgstr "<CHANGING_ENDS>"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<CHANGING_FAILED>"
#: data/json/mutations/changing_eocs.json
msgid "You feel a shift in your body, but it quickly reverts."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<CHANGING_FAILED>"
#: data/json/mutations/changing_eocs.json
msgid "Your flesh has taken on an impatient wriggling sensation."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<CHANGING_FAILED>"
#: data/json/mutations/changing_eocs.json
msgid "Your skin feels like wax.  Or wet clay."
msgstr ""
"Votre peau vous donne l'impression d'être composée de cire ou d'argile "
"humide."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<CHANGING_FAILED>"
#: data/json/mutations/changing_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You feel as though you're on the cusp of something, if you just give it a "
"bit more time…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<CHANGING_FAILED>"
#: data/json/mutations/changing_eocs.json
msgid "Your vision swims.  You feel dizzy."
msgstr "Votre vision se trouble. Vous avez le vertige."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<CHANGING_FAILED>"
#: data/json/mutations/changing_eocs.json
msgid ""
"It won't be long now.  Your innards flex and twist in anticipatory "
"contortions."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<CHANGING_SUCCESS>"
#: data/json/mutations/changing_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You begin to feel a sickeningly beautiful ache, the feeling of your cells "
"tearing apart and recombining in strange new patterns."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<CHANGING_SUCCESS>"
#: data/json/mutations/changing_eocs.json
msgid "Your body is slowly reshaping itself!"
msgstr "Votre corps est lentement en train de se réarranger!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<CHANGING_SUCCESS>"
#: data/json/mutations/changing_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Every muscle you have begins to minutely spasm and cramp as your body starts"
" morphing, slowly, in unearthly new ways."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<CHANGING_SUCCESS>"
#: data/json/mutations/changing_eocs.json
msgid "You feel your chest wriggle and begin to palpitate.  Here we go."
msgstr ""
"Vous ressentez votre poitrine frétiller et commencer à palpiter. C'est "
"reparti."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<CHANGING_SUCCESS>"
#: data/json/mutations/changing_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Tiny ripples begin appearing in your skin and radiating outward like waves."
"  It is indescribably uncomfortable."
msgstr ""
"De ondulations minuscules apparaissent à travers votre peau et rayonnent "
"vers l'extérieur comme des vagues, ceci étant extrêmement inconfortable."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<CHANGING_ENDS>"
#: data/json/mutations/changing_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You can palpably feel the churning sensation within fade, your mutation cut "
"short by a lack of nutrients."
msgstr ""
"Vous pouvez palper la sensation d’ébullition à l'intérieur de vous "
"s’évanouir, votre mutation arrêtée par un manque de nutriments."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<CHANGING_ENDS>"
#: data/json/mutations/changing_eocs.json
msgid ""
"The strain of mutation fades, leaving a throbbing sensation like a bad "
"headache.  Or an afterglow."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<CHANGING_ENDS>"
#: data/json/mutations/changing_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You're pulled back to reality as your body stops warping, leaving you in "
"your current state for the time being."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<CHANGING_ENDS>"
#: data/json/mutations/changing_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Your mutation abruptly ends from a lack of nutrients.  Back to Earth for "
"now."
msgstr ""

