msgstr "Vous avez de meilleures idées?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Military Black Box"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Survivors were talking about them crashing but I don't know where.  If I "
"were a pilot I'd avoid crash landing in a city or forest though."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Military Black Box"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Black Box Transcript"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "How 'bout that black box?"
msgstr "Et au sujet de cette boite noire?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Military Black Box"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "America, fuck yeah!"
msgstr "America fuck yeah!"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Military Black Box"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Black Box Transcript"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "What?!  I oughta whip your ass."
msgstr "QUOI?! J'vais t'botter l'cul!"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Military Black Box"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Damn, I'll have to find 'er myself."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Retrieve Black Box Transcript"
msgstr "Récupérer une transcription d'une boîte noire militaire"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Black Box Transcript"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "With the black box in hand, we need to find a lab."
msgstr "Avec la boite noir en notre possession, nous d'vons trouver un labo."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Black Box Transcript"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Thanks to your searching we've got the black box but now we need to have a "
"look inside her.  Now, most buildings don't have power anymore but there are"
" a few that might be of use.  Have you ever seen one of those science labs "
"that have popped up in the middle of nowhere?  Them suckers have a glowing "
"terminal out front so I know they have power somewhere inside 'em.  If you "
"can get inside and find a computer lab that still works you ought to be able"
" to find out what's in the black box."
msgstr ""
"Grâce à tes recherches, nous avons la boîte noire, mais maintenant nous "
"devons jeter un œil à l'intérieur. Puisque, la plupart des bâtiments n'ont "
"plus d'jus, il doit bien y en avoir quelques-uns qui pourraient être utiles."
" T'as déjà vu un de ces labo qui ont surgi d'milieu de nulle part ? Ces "
"saloperies ont un terminal lumineux à l'avant donc j'pense qu'il y a de "
"l'énergie quelque part à l'intérieur. Si tu peux trouver un labo "
"d'informatique qui fonctionne encore, tu pourra peut-être trouver ce qu'il y"
" a dans la boîte noire."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Black Box Transcript"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"When I was playin' with the terminal for the one I ran into it kept asking "
"for an ID card.  Finding one would be the first order of business."
msgstr ""
"Quand je bidouillais l'terminal, il demandait une carte d’identification. "
"Faut en trouver une !"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Black Box Transcript"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"America, fuck yeah!  I was in the guard a few years back so I'm confident I "
"can make heads-or-tails of these transmissions."
msgstr ""
"America, fuck yeah!  J'étais dans la Garde National, y a quelques années, "
"donc je suis sûr que je peux m'occuper d'ces transmissions."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Black Box Transcript"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Damn, I maybe we can find an egg-head to crack the terminal."
msgstr ""
"Merde, on peut p't'être trouver une tête d'œuf pour pirater l'terminal."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Find Deputy Badge"
msgstr "Trouver le badge du shériff adjoint"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Deputy Badge"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Corporate Accounts"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Deposit Box"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Secrets in Leather Journal"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Those twisted snakes…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Deputy Badge"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I hope you will find use from what you got out of the deposit box but I also"
" have another job for you that might lead you to an opportunity to deal out "
"justice for those who cannot.  First things first, we can't just look like "
"ruffians.  Find us a deputy badge, easy enough?"
msgstr ""
"J'espère que vous trouverez votre bonheur dans le coffre, j'ai une autre "
"mission pour vous qui pourrait votre permettre de rendre justice à ceux qui "
"ne le peuvent pas. D'abord, on ne peut pas avoir l'air de voyous. Trouvez "
"moi un badge de shériff adjoint, facile non?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Deputy Badge"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I'd check the police station."
msgstr "J'irais voir au commissariat."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Deputy Badge"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"We're also official… just hang in there and I'll show you what we can really"
" do."
msgstr ""
"Nous sommes officiels aussi... attendez là et je vais vous montrer ce qu'on "
"sait faire."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Deputy Badge"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "They shouldn't be that hard to find… should they?"
msgstr "Ils ne devraient pas être difficiles à trouver... non?"

