"You give up?  This country fell apart because no one could find a good man "
"to rely on… might as well give up, I guess."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Find Corporate Accounts"
msgstr "Trouver les comptes des corporations"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Corporate Accounts"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Our world fell apart because our leaders were as crooked as the con-men that"
" paid for their elections.  Just find me one of those corporate accounting "
"books and I'll show you and the rest of the world just who is at fault."
msgstr ""
"Notre monde est tombé en ruine car nos dirigeants étaient aussi tordus que "
"les escrocs payés pour leur élection. Trouvez moi l'un des livres de comptes"
" de ces corporations et je vous montrerai ainsi qu'au reste du monde de qui "
"c'est la faute."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Corporate Accounts"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "You'll see, I know I'm right."
msgstr "Vous verrez, je sais que j'ai raison."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Corporate Accounts"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I know it isn't pressing but the big corporations didn't get a chance to "
"destroy the evidence yet."
msgstr ""
"Je sais que ça ne presse pas mais les grandes corporations n'ont pas encore "
"pu détruire les preuves."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Corporate Accounts"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Try a big corporate building of some sort, they're bound to have an "
"accounting department."
msgstr ""
"Essayez l'un des grands bâtiments de ces sociétés, ils doivent bien avoir un"
" secteur comptabilité."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Corporate Accounts"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Great, let's see… uh… hmmm….  Fine, I didn't even do my own taxes but I'm "
"sure this will prove their guilt if we get an expert to examine it."
msgstr ""
"Super, voyons... heu... hummm... Bon, je ne me suis jamais occupé de mes "
"impôts mais je suis sûr que cela prouve leur culpabilité si on trouve un "
"expert pour l'examiner."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Corporate Accounts"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Retrieve Deposit Box"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"The day of reckoning will come for the corporations if it hasn't already."
msgstr ""
"Le jour des règlements de compte va arriver pour les corporations si ce "
"n'est pas déjà le cas."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Find Patient Records"
msgstr "Trouver la liste des patients"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Patient Records"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Patient Records in Leather Journal"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I hope I don't see many names I know…"
msgstr "J'espère ne pas voir beaucoup de noms que je connais..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Patient Records"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I've lost so many friends… please find me a patient list from the regional "
"hospital or doctor's office.  I just want to know who might still be out "
"there."
msgstr ""
"J'ai perdu tellement d'amis... S'il vous plait, trouvez moi une liste de "
"patients de l'hôpital régional ou d'un cabinet de médecin. J'aimerais savoir"
" ceux qui sont encore en vie."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Patient Records"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Patient Records in Leather Journal"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Thank you, I suppose it won't change what has already happened but it will "
"bring me closure."
msgstr ""
"Merci, ça ne changera pas le cour des choses mais je sais à quoi m'en tenir."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Patient Records"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Patient Records in Leather Journal"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Please, I just want to know what happened to everyone."
msgstr ""
"S'il vous plait, je veux juste savoir ce qui est arrivé à tout le monde."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Patient Records"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"I bet you'll run into a lot of those things in the hospital, please be "
"careful."
msgstr ""
"Je parie que vous allez tomber sur beaucoup de ces trucs dans l'hôpital, "
"soyez prudent."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Patient Records"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Oh dear, I thought Timmy would have made it…"
msgstr "Oh non, je pensais que Timmy s'en sortirait..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Patient Records"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Reach FEMA Camp"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Patient Records in Leather Journal"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I bet some of them are still out there…"
msgstr "Je suis sûr que certains d'entre eux sont encore là..."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Find Weather Log"
msgstr "Trouver le rapport météo"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Weather Log"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Weather Log in Leather Journal"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I wonder if a retreat might exist…"
msgstr "Je me demande si une retraite est possible..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Weather Log"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"Everyone who dies gets back up, right?  Which means that whatever is causing"
" this it must be airborne to have infected everyone.  I believe that if that"
" is the case then there should be regions that were not downwind from where-"
"ever the disease was released.  We need to find a record of all the weather "
"patterns leading up to the outbreak."
msgstr ""
"Tout ceux qui meurent reviennent, vrai? Ce qui signifie que la cause vient "
"des airs et a infecté tout le monde. Je pense qu'il doit exister des zones "
"qui n'ont pas été touchés. Nous devons trouver un enregistrement des "
"conditions climatiques au moment de l'événement."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Weather Log"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Weather Log in Leather Journal"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Thanks so much, you may save both of us yet."
msgstr "Merci beaucoup, vous nous sauvez la mise."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Weather Log"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Prove You're A Survivor"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Weather Log in Leather Journal"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Ya, it was a long shot I admit."
msgstr "Ouai, c'était un long tir je dois l'admettre."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Weather Log"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I'm not sure, maybe a news station would have what we are looking for?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Weather Log"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Weather Log in Leather Journal"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "These look more complicated than I thought, just give me some time."
msgstr ""
"C'est plus compliqué que ce que je pensais, donnez moi un peu de temps."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Weather Log"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Weather Log in Leather Journal"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "This isn't what we need."
msgstr "Ce n'est pas ce qu'il nous faut."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Weather Log"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Weather Log in Leather Journal"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "If only we could find a great valley or something."
msgstr ""
"Si seulement on pouvait trouver une grande vallée ou quelque chose du genre."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Find a Holy Symbol"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a Holy Symbol"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Any variant is fine, I am not that choosy…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a Holy Symbol"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"The sky has torn apart and creatures beyond our wildest imaginations lurk in"
" the dark now.  I beg you, find me a holy symbol.  Maybe some faith can help"
" me sleep better at night."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a Holy Symbol"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "May whatever god or spirits that now reign the world protect you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a Holy Symbol"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "I guess the stress may just be getting to me…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a Holy Symbol"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid ""
"A church must be full of them and who knows, maybe some of those <zombies> "
"carry some.  But please, do not waste your time making one yourself."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a Holy Symbol"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Any luck?  Please find me a holy symbol.  Any of them will do."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a Holy Symbol"
#: data/json/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "Thank the heavens."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a Holy Symbol"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find an anvil"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a copy of the Quran"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make a makeshift haircut kit for Vanessa Toby
