"[Masse, 80 merch, 20 cartouches de .22 LR] On se revoit dans 2 semaines."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_prototype.json
msgid ""
"The beast is done!  Really heavy-duty, but really packs a punch.  Be careful"
" with your fingers.  I'm serious, this thing could tear 'em off."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
