msgid ""
"Expert improvement on the chance of hitting the Weakpoint Monster's weak "
"points."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Principles of Zombie Biology"
msgstr "Principes de la Biologie Zombie"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Principles of Zombie Biology"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Very basic familiarity with various types of undead creatures."
msgstr ""
"Une familiarité très basique avec l'anatomie de différents types de "
"créatures zombifiées."

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Principles of Near Human Biology"
msgstr "Principes de la Biologie Presque-Humaine"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Principles of Near Human Biology"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Very basic familiarity with various types of demihuman creatures."
msgstr ""
"Une familiarité très basique avec l'anatomie de différents types de "
"créatures demi-humaines."

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Anatomy of Amalgamations"
msgstr "Anatomie d'Amalgames"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Anatomy of Amalgamations"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid ""
"You are familiar with the common anatomy of these purpose-built "
"abominations, as far as they have one."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez une assez bonne familiarité avec les quelques aspects en commun de"
" l'anatomie de ces abominations spécialisées."

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Synthetic Armors"
msgstr "Armures Synthétiques"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Synthetic Armors"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid ""
"Understanding of man-made armors and ways to exploit them.  You're able to "
"find openings in certain kinds of body armor."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez une assez bonne connaissances des matériaux synthétiques et de la "
"façon de pénétrer une armure composée de ceux-ci."

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Natural Armors"
msgstr "Armures Naturelles"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Natural Armors"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid ""
"You're somewhat familiar with naturally armored creatures.  You're able to "
"find openings in certain kinds of hardened shells and thick hides."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez une assez bonne connaissance de l'anatomie commune aux créatures "
"naturellement dotées d'une carapace, coquille ou peau épaisse, vous "
"permettant de discerner et exploiter les lacunes et points faibles de "
"celles-ci."

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Cyborg Anatomy"
msgstr "Anatomie Cyborg"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Cyborg Anatomy"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid ""
"You're somewhat familiar with cybernetic creatures.  You're able to find "
"openings and gaps that aren't as hardened."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez une connaissance basique des créatures cybernétiques, ce qui vous "
"permets de trouver et exploiter les lacunes et points faibles de celles-ci."

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Bird Biology"
msgstr "Biologie Aviaire"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Bird Biology"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Basic familiarity with various types of birds."
msgstr "Familiarité basique avec différents types d'oiseaux et leur anatomie."

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Invertebrate Biology"
msgstr "Anatomie Invertébrée"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Invertebrate Biology"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Basic familiarity with various types of insects, arachnids, and worms."
msgstr ""
"Familiarité basique avec une variété d'animaux invertébrés (insectes, "
"arachnides et vers) et leurs anatomies respectives."

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Beetle Anatomy"
msgstr "Anatomie Coléoptèrienne"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Beetle Anatomy"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid ""
"You are familiar with the anatomy of mutated beetles - bypassing their thick"
" armor should be easier."
msgstr ""
"Vous possédez une expertise décente de l'anatomie de scarabées mutants, vous"
" permettant de limiter l'effet de leurs armures épaisses en exploitant leurs"
" points faibles."

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Centipede Anatomy"
msgstr "Anatomie Chilopodienne"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Centipede Anatomy"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid ""
"You are familiar with the anatomy of mutated centipedes, letting you target "
"their less-deadly parts with ease."
msgstr ""
"Vous possédez une bonne quantité d'expérience pratique sur les centipèdes "
"mutants, vous permettant de facilement cibler leurs point faibles au lieu de"
" leurs mandibules menaçantes."

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Hymenopteran Anatomy"
msgstr "Anatomie Hyménoptèrienne"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Hymenopteran Anatomy"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid ""
"Familiarity with the comparative anatomy of mutant Hymenopterans - ants, "
"bees, and wasps of all kinds.  You find it easier to exploit their weak "
"points, and possibly disable their natural weaponry."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez une bonne connaissance de l'anatomie des Hyménoptères mutants, "
"vous permettant de discerner et exploiter les points faibles des abeilles, "
"guêpes et fourmis,. Vous êtes aussi capable d'identifier comment mettre hors"
" d'état leurs armes naturelles."

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Arachnid Anatomy"
msgstr "Anatomie Arachnéenne"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Arachnid Anatomy"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid ""
"You are familiar with the anatomy of mutated spiders of all shapes and "
"sizes."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez une bonne familiarité avec l'anatomie d'araignées mutantes d'une "
"variété de tailles et formes."

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Creatures of Flight"
msgstr "Anatomie des Créatures Volantes"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Creatures of Flight"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid ""
"Basic understanding of what's needed for certain creatures to fly, as well "
"as ways of preventing it."
msgstr ""
"Une connaissance basique de ce qui permets à certaines créatures de voler, "
"et comment les empêcher de faire ceci."

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Ossified Exoskeletons"
msgstr "Exosquelettes Ossifiés"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Ossified Exoskeletons"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid ""
"You're familiar with creatures presenting unsettling bones on their outer "
"structure."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez une bonne familiarité avec l'anatomie des créatures dotés de "
"plaques ossifiées recouvrant leur corps."

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Small Humanoids"
msgstr "Petits Humanoïdes"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Small Humanoids"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid ""
"You have some practice in fighting small humanoids like children.  You don't"
" necessarily feel good about it."
msgstr ""
"Vous maitrisez assez bien la façon de se battre contre des humanoides de "
"taille réduite comme les enfants. Ceci ne veut pas dire que vous aimez "
"particulièrement vous battre contre eux."

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Giant Humanoids"
msgstr "Humanoïdes Géants"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Giant Humanoids"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid ""
"You have some practice in fighting large, hulking humanoids.  You're better "
"at reaching certain weak points."
msgstr ""
"Vous maitrisez la façon de vous battre contre des humanoïdes énormes, et "
"êtes capable d'attaquer certains de leurs points faibles."

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/wilderness.json
msgid "Fiber Twisting"
msgstr "Torsion de Fibres"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Fiber Twisting"
#: data/json/proficiencies/wilderness.json
msgid ""
"You've got a basic grasp of the theory of how to twist and arrange fibers "
"into a more durable cord."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/wilderness.json
msgid "Ropemaking"
msgstr "Corderie"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Ropemaking"
#: data/json/proficiencies/wilderness.json
msgid "Making twisted fibers into durable and useful rope."
msgstr "L'art d'assembler des cordes solides et utiles à partir de fibres."

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/wilderness.json
msgid "Basic Tanning"
msgstr "Tannage Basique"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Basic Tanning"
#: data/json/proficiencies/wilderness.json
msgid "You're familiar with the theory behind turning raw hides into leather."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez un niveau d'expertise basique dans l'art de transformer des peaux "
"en cuir."

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/wilderness.json
msgid "Skilled Tanning"
msgstr "Tannage Qualifié"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Skilled Tanning"
#: data/json/proficiencies/wilderness.json
msgid ""
"You have a lot of practice and experience with processing hides to leather, "
"as well as related techniques like making boiled leather."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez beaucoup de savoir-faire et d'expériences dans la transformation "
"de peaux en cuir, ainsi que dans d'autres proches disciplines, comme la "
"fabrication du cuir bouilli."

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/wilderness.json
msgid "Archer's Form"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Archer's Form"
#: data/json/proficiencies/wilderness.json
msgid ""
"You have grasped some basic understanding on archery, and find handling bows"
" easier."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/wilderness.json
msgid "Archer's Form (Expert)"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Archer's Form (Expert)"
#: data/json/proficiencies/wilderness.json
msgid ""
"After significant practice, you have become experienced in the movements "
"used in drawing and firing a bow, and have strengthened those muscles "
"considerably."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/wilderness.json
msgid "Archer's Form (Master)"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Archer's Form (Master)"
#: data/json/proficiencies/wilderness.json
msgid ""
"You have drawn and fired a bow so many times, you probably have a bit of a "
"twist in your spine from it.  You've developed at least a professional-level"
" understanding of the pose and motion of effective archery."
msgstr ""

