#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"A short, silent CCTV tape of some small rest stop near a highway.  The whole"
" video is pretty glitched, and some parts are completely pitch black.  Near "
"the end, a huge explosion can be seen on the horizon, all while the camera "
"obviously malfunctions.  After a second, a grim and unnervingly familiar "
"mushroom cloud rises from the same spot, and the video ends."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
