"Downloads/government_lies_to_you.mp4\n"
"\n"
"A 20 minute video of some freak with a lot of trinkets on his body, who tries to explain that the mass hysteria cases aren't caused by chinese mind control agents.  His own version, that it was the work of \"mushroom people i saw a few days ago\" doesn't sound correct either."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
