"infected loved ones or friends to any hospitals, they are being currently "
"overwhelmed due to the volume of incoming patients.  Restrain those believed"
" to be infected, and wait for further information at www.cdc.gov.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "flier"
#: data/json/snippets/fliers.json
msgid ""
