"Vous vous sentez gelé malgré la température. Vous avez besoin de la chaleur "
"d'un feu."

#. ~ Snippet in category "pyromania_withdrawal"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "Maybe a fire could calm your nerves?"
msgstr "Peut être que commencer un bon incendie vous aiderait à vous relaxer?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "pyromania_withdrawal"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "You need to ignite something."
msgstr "Vous devez mettre feu à quelque chose."

#. ~ Snippet in category "pyromania_withdrawal"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "You daydream of crackling fire…"
msgstr "Vous avez une rêverie d'un brasier incontrollable."

#. ~ Snippet in category "pyromania_withdrawal"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "You shiver.  A fire would be great right now."
msgstr "Vous frissonnez. Un feu ferait du bien là maintenant."

#. ~ Snippet in category "pyromania_withdrawal"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "You think about how nice fires are."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "pyromania_withdrawal"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "You think of randomly lighting a fire, but decide against it."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez l'envie de mettre feu à quelque chose au hasard, et arrivez à "
"peine à la repousser."

#. ~ Snippet in category "killer_withdrawal"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "You think of steel blades and warm, dripping blood."
msgstr ""
"Vous songez de lames en acier et de sang chaud ruisselant le long de celles-"
"ci."

#. ~ Snippet in category "killer_withdrawal"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "You'd like to hear the last breath of something living."
msgstr "Vous aimeriez entendre le dernier soupir d'un être vivant."

#. ~ Snippet in category "killer_withdrawal"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "So much death around.  Why not add some more?"
msgstr "Tellement de mort partout. Où serait le mal d'en ajouter un peu plus?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "killer_withdrawal"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "You lick your lips, in anticipation for dead trophies."
msgstr "Vous léchez vos lèvres en anticipation de plus de trophées."

#. ~ Snippet in category "killer_withdrawal"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "By the blade or by the gun?  How will you kill this time?"
msgstr "Avec la lame ou le fusil? Comment tuerez-vous cette fois?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "killer_withdrawal"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "Ahh, how delightful it would be to kill something."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "killer_withdrawal"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "You are death, and you are coming for them.  Soon."
msgstr "Vous êtes la mort, et vous l'apporterez à quelque chose sous peu."

#. ~ Snippet in category "killer_withdrawal"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "You feel restless.  It's been too long since your last kill."
msgstr ""
"Vous vous sentez agité(e). Votre dernière proie remonte à trop longtemps."

#. ~ Snippet in category "killer_withdrawal"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "Killing something would be nice right now."
msgstr "Ce serait apaisant pour vous de tuer quelque chose bientôt."

#. ~ Snippet in category "killer_withdrawal"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "Just one more death, one more kill and then you'd be right."
msgstr ""
"Juste une autre victime, un autre meurtre, et tout ira bien de nouveau."

#. ~ Snippet in category "killer_on_kill"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "You feel the rush of the kill."
msgstr "Vous ressentez l'adrenaline du prédateur."

#. ~ Snippet in category "killer_on_kill"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "Your urge to kill is sated, for now."
msgstr "Votre soif de sang est rassasiée, pour l'instant."

#. ~ Snippet in category "killer_on_kill"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "You have the power of life and death; it feels good to be in control."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez le pouvoir de donner la vie ou la mort, ça fait du bien d'avoir le"
" contrôle."

#. ~ Snippet in category "killer_on_kill"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "You exhale in bliss."
msgstr "Vous soupirez de bonheur."

#. ~ Snippet in category "killer_on_kill"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "A calm feeling washes over."
msgstr "Un sentiment de calme vous submerge."

#. ~ Snippet in category "killer_on_kill"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "This feels right."
msgstr "Vous vous sentez bien."

#. ~ Snippet in category "killer_on_kill"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "You kill, and your world is in order again."
msgstr "Vous tuez, et tout semble se remettre en ordre dans votre tête."

#. ~ Snippet in category "killer_on_kill"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "Your worries evaporate as the creature dies by your hand."
msgstr ""
"Vos soucis s'évaporent avec les derniers frémissements de votre victime."

#. ~ Snippet in category "killer_on_kill"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "That was nice!  Maybe one more?"
msgstr "Ceci était parfait! Peut être un de plus?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "killer_on_kill"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "This feels so good!  You could do this all day."
msgstr ""
"Vous vous sentez tellement bien! Vous pourriez faire ceci toute la journée."

#. ~ Snippet in category "killer_on_kill"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "This brings a smile to your face."
msgstr "Ceci mets un sourire sur votre visage."

#. ~ Snippet in category "killer_on_kill"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "You feel tension leave your body as your need to kill is satisfied."
msgstr ""
"Vous sentez la tension quitter votre corps avec votre besoin de tuer "
"satisfait."

#. ~ Snippet in category "killer_on_kill"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "You feel much better now."
msgstr "Vous vous sentez beaucoup mieux."

