msgstr ""
"Un frisson de compréhension passe à travers vos racines et le long de votre "
"échine."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tree_communion"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "You gain new appreciation for the interconnectedness of life."
msgstr ""
"Vous recevez une nouvelle appréciation de l'interconnection des êtres "
"vivants."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tree_communion"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "You ask, and the trees answer."
msgstr "Vous posez une question, et les arbres répondent."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tree_communion"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "You see the forest for the trees."
msgstr "Vous discernez chaque arbre individuel composant la forêt."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tree_communion"
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
