"A broken tank drone.  Still looks intimidating despite being permanently "
"inoperative, possibly due to the sheer size and mass.  Could be gutted for "
"parts."
msgstr ""
"Un drone tank cassé. Bien que complétement inopérant, il reste intimidant, "
"peut être a cause de sa taille énorme. Il pourrait être démembré pour "
"pièces."

