msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "Jane's Flamethrowers and Firestarters"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/obsolete.json
msgid ""
"A detailed, full-colored guide to flamethrowers, incendiary weapons, and "
"napalm.  It builds off of information provided in its sister book, Jane's "
"Mortars and Rocket Launchers, and so it's mostly incomprehensible to anyone "
