msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "UPS"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/tools.json
msgid ""
"This is a unified power supply, or UPS.  It is a device developed jointly by"
" military and scientific interests for use in combat and the field.  The UPS"
" is designed to power armor and some guns, but drains batteries quickly.  It"
" can be worn strapped to either leg for ease of access, and it's been "
"waterproofed to protect the delicate electronics.  Has its own custom "
"battery, rechargeable and with higher capacity, but not removable"
msgstr ""

