#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/laser.json
msgid ""
"Straight from the bureaus of the old Soviet Union the PLC-75 is the crude "
"and brutal answer to the constraints posed by the design of heavy laser "
"ordnance.  Its use of antiquated flashtube pumped laser technology makes it "
"unwieldy and wholly incompatible with modern equipment, whether this offers "
"any consolation to downrange targets remains a matter of contentious "
"dispute."
msgstr ""

