#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/gun/laser.json
msgid ""
"Crown jewel of Shikishma armories, and possible product of unsanctioned data"
" scavenging, the A-82 is the undisputed market leader when it comes to man "
"portable laser weaponry.  Sustained fire is likely to cause secondary "
"explosions as target layers are vaporized."
msgstr ""

