msgstr[1] "robots militaires lance-flammes"
msgstr[2] "robots militaires lance-flammes"

#. ~ Description of monster "military flame robot"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/mobs/obsolete.json
msgid ""
"A military robot still operating due to its internal power core.  This one "
"is armed with an electric prod and an integrated flamethrower."
