msgid "Escaping Crew"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Escaping Crew" for male
#: data/mods/Aftershock/player/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You awake in your cabin to the sound of emergency sirens and the ship's "
"computer calmly announcing in a posh English voice 'Abandon the vessel "
"immediately.', and then counting down from five minutes.  You've got just "
"enough time to hit a supply locker before you need to activate the escape "
"pod down the hall."
msgstr ""

