"Take to the skies with a rocket assisted jump or dash.  You might target a "
"hostile creature to perform a powerful rocket kick at the end of the dash.  "
"The rocket pack allows for a brief moment of air control or hovering after a"
" jump."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Spell name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/spells/jetpack_spells.json
