msgid ""
"What is this place?  You can't seem to find your way back out.  But hey, at "
"least you aren't alone.  Will you cannibalize them as a last resort?  Maybe "
"get them to surgically implant bionics into you?  Just keep them around for "
"company?  Maybe you two will protect each other?  The possibilities have "
"just widened, my friend, for you are no longer one.  You are two, and that's"
" better than what it used to be like."
