msgstr "Empathie Zombie"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Zombie Empathy"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/empath.json
msgid ""
"You are really feeling for the last zombie you killed.  That must have been "
"really hard for it to die again.  Though you aren't really feeling pain "
"right now."
msgstr ""

