#. ~ Description of "burnt out Louisville Slaughterer"
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
msgid ""
"A sturdy wood bat, wrapped in flame-resistant Nomex fabric.  Makes a good "
"melee weapon but better be disassembled to recycle the baseball bat and some"
" Nomex patches."
msgstr ""
"Une solide batte en bois, enrobée de tissu nomex résistant au feu. Faite une"
" bonne arme de mêlée mais devrais être désassemblée pour récupérer la batte "
"et des patchs de nomex."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
msgid "Louisville Slaughterer"
msgid_plural "Louisville Slaughterers"
msgstr[0] "massacreur de Louisville"
msgstr[1] "massacreurs de Louisville"
msgstr[2] "massacreurs de Louisville"

#. ~ Description of "Louisville Slaughterer"
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
msgid ""
"This is sturdy wood bat, wrapped in gasoline-soaked rags and flame-resistant"
" Nomex fabric.  Light it, and the ball game will REALLY heat up.  You'll "
"need a lighter or matches to light it."
msgstr ""
"Une batte en bois robuste, enroulée dans des chiffons imbibés d'essence et "
"de Nomex résistant aux flammes. Allumez le, et le jeu de balle va VRAIMENT "
"chauffer. Il vous faut un briquet ou des allumettes pour l'allumer."

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "Louisville Slaughterer"
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
msgid "You light the Louisville Slaughterer."
msgstr "Vous allumez le massacreur de Louisville."

#. ~ Description of "Louisville Slaughterer"
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
msgid ""
"This is a sturdy wood bat, wrapped in gasoline-soaked rags and flame-"
"resistant Nomex fabric.  It is burning brightly, and makes it much easier to"
" see the baselines at night games (It also makes the umpire FAR more likely "
"to call a ball instead of a strike)."
msgstr ""
"Une batte en bois robuste, enroulée dans des chiffons imbibés d'essence et "
"de Nomex résistant aux flammes. Il brûle vivement, et facilite beaucoup la "
"vue de nuit (l'arbitre sera également beaucoup plus susceptible d'annoncer "
"une balle au lieu d'une prise)."

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "Louisville Slaughterer"
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_items.json
msgid "The Louisville Slaughterer is extinguished."
msgstr "Le massacreur de Louisville est éteint."

