#. ~ Description of "shotshell, junk"
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"A shotgun shell filled with whatever was lying around.  They are more "
"damaging than birdshot, but fairly inaccurate."
msgstr ""
"Une cartouche de fusil de chasse remplie de tout ce qui trainait dans le "
"coin. Elle fait plus de dégâts que la grenaille, mais est assez imprécise."

