msgid_plural "alumentum"
msgstr[0] "alumentum"
msgstr[1] "alumentum"
msgstr[2] "alumentum"

#. ~ Description of "alumentum"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
msgid ""
"Alumentum is magically processed coal or charcoal.  It burns as hot as "
"magnesium, and for a significantly longer period of time.  One of the very "
"few magical materials that is still produced in any quantity today due to "
"its usefulness."
msgstr ""
"Une forme de charbon ou charbon de bois ayant été magiquement altéré et "
"brulant aussi chaud que du magnésium sur une durée bien supérieure. L'un des"
" rares matériaux magiques encore fabriqués en masse de nos jours dû à son "
"utilité."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/alchemy_items.json
