msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ based on a bone shiv.
#. ~ Description of "biomancer's bone syringe"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/caster_level_boosters.json
msgid ""
"A hollow bone, about 20 cm long, which has been broken at one end and "
"sharpened into a crude syringe.  A biomancer rune is carved on the surface."
"  By jabbing it into yourself, you can release stored biomancer booster "
"sludge into yourself, thereby boosting your biomancer caster level by 1 for "
"a while.  Doing so is about as painful as it sounds."
msgstr ""

#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "biomancer's bone syringe"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/caster_level_boosters.json
msgid ""
"You feel a surge of power as the bone syringe deposits the sludge inside "
"your body."
msgstr ""

