#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/obsolete/contemplation_notes.json
msgid ""
"You study the note and contemplate ways that you might improve your powers "
"(check practice recipes)."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/obsolete/obsolete.json
msgid ""
"You feel more confident in your telekinesis, as though you could carry at "
"least one thing with barely any concentration required."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/obsolete/obsolete.json
