#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "EOC_CENTERING_MEDITATION"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/recipes/drain.json
msgid ""
"Through practice, you've learned how to calm and focus yourself during "
"meditation.  If you meditated properly, you could channel the unnatural "
"drain of psionic channeling into mundane tiredness, though it may take some "
"time to meditate all of your drain away."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Custom name for recipe crafting "EOC_CENTERING_MEDITATION"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/recipes/drain.json
msgid "centering meditation"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "EOC_MATRIX_DRAIN_MEDITATION"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/recipes/drain.json
msgid ""
"That report indicated there was a way to channel all of the unnatural "
"fatigue from long-term psionic use into a focusing object.  All you need is "
"a drained matrix crystal and time."
msgstr ""
"Le rapport indiquait qu'il existe un moyen de canaliser toute la fatigue "
"anormale liée à l'utilisation à long terme de pouvoirs psioniques en "
"utilisant un objet de focalisation. Tout ce dont vous avez besoin est un "
"cristal matriciel vidé et du temps."

#. ~ Custom name for recipe crafting "EOC_MATRIX_DRAIN_MEDITATION"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/recipes/drain.json
msgid "drain channeling protocol PGS38"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/recipes/drain.json
msgid ""
"You channel all of the unnatural fatigue into the drained matrix crystal in "
"your hands.  As you do, the faint light in its depths grows steadily "
"brighter and the crystal begins to feel warm in your hands.  Suddenly, the "
"crystal shatters…and with it, all of the fatigue your powers caused you "
"vanishes."
msgstr ""
"Vous canalisez toute votre fatigue anormale dans le cristal matriciel vidé "
"que vous tenez dans vos mains. Celui-ci manifeste une lueur en son cœur "
"devenant de plus en plus forte au fur et à mesure de votre progression, et "
"le cristal commence à se réchauffer. Soudainement, le cristal vole en "
"éclats… et avec lui, toute la fatigue causée par l'utilisation de vos "
"pouvoirs s'évanouit."

