msgid "The Sweet Life"
msgstr "La Douceur de Vie"

#. ~ Scenario name for female
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_female"
msgid "The Sweet Life"
msgstr "La Douceur de Vie"

#. ~ Description of scenario "The Sweet Life" for male
#: data/mods/My_Sweet_Cataclysm/sweet_scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You open your eyes as if for the first time.  Looking at yourself, you can "
"see your skin glisten in the light.  One word comes to your mind: \"sugar\"."
"  You don't remember where you learned it, and in fact you don't seem to "
"remember anything.  Despite the circumstances, you feel quite hopeful.  "
"Everything feels new and you're going to make the best of it!"
msgstr ""

