#. ~ Description of gun "sonic gun"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/inventor/gun.json
msgid ""
"Small, square tube with pistol grip, that can emit a sonic waves, creating "
"cavitation and tissue damage inside the living creatures.  Pretty weak as a "
"weapon, using extremely high frequency sounds make it silent for most "
"creatures you can met.  Would be fun to listen some music using it, but "
"alas."
msgstr ""

