msgstr[1] "blaireaux monstrueux"
msgstr[2] "blaireaux monstrueux"

#. ~ Description of monster "monstrous badger"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/elementals.json
msgid ""
"A fairly large badger burrowed up through the ground near you.  It is both "
"larger than garden variety badgers and strangely seems to have more "
"intelligence in it."
msgstr ""

