msgid "Shaman"
msgstr "Chaman"

#. ~ Description of profession "Shaman" for male
#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've trained in the medical arts, refining natural remedies into real "
"cures for disease.  Your tribe would have lived long and healthy lives, were"
" they still here."
msgstr ""

