#: src/game.cpp:9247
msgid "missing proficiencies"
msgstr "aptitudes manquantes"

#: src/game.cpp:9249
msgid "already known"
msgstr "déjà appris"

#: src/game.cpp:9261
msgid "Choose type of butchery:"
msgstr "Choisissez le type de boucherie:"

#: src/game.cpp:9263
msgid "can't see!"
msgstr "impossible de voir ce que vous faîtes!"

#: src/game.cpp:9266
msgid "Quick butchery"
msgstr "Boucherie rapide"

#: src/game.cpp:9269
msgid ""
"This technique is used when you are in a hurry, but still want to harvest "
"something from the corpse.  Yields are lower as you don't try to be precise,"
" but it's useful if you don't want to set up a workshop.  Prevents zombies "
"from raising."
msgstr ""
"Cette technique est utilisée lorsque vous êtes pressé, mais que vous "
"souhaitez tout de même récupérer quelque chose du cadavre. Les rendements "
"sont plus bas car vous n'essayez pas d'être précis, mais c'est utile si vous"
" ne voulez pas organiser un atelier. Empêche les zombies de se relever."

#: src/game.cpp:9276
msgid "Full butchery"
msgstr "Boucherie complète"

#: src/game.cpp:9279
msgid ""
"This technique is used to properly butcher a corpse, and requires a rope & a"
" tree or a butchering rack, a flat surface (for ex. a table, a leather tarp,"
" etc.) and good tools.  Yields are plentiful and varied, but it is time "
"consuming."
msgstr ""
"Cette technique est utilisée pour bien dépecer un cadavre et nécessite une "
"corde et un arbre ou une grille de boucher, une surface plane (par exemple "
"une table, une bâche en cuir, etc.) et de bons outils. Les rendements sont "
"abondants et variés, mais cela prend du temps."

#: src/game.cpp:9286
msgid "Field dress corpse"
msgstr "Vider le corps"

#: src/game.cpp:9288
msgid "has no organs"
msgstr "aucun organe à vider"

#: src/game.cpp:9290
msgid ""
"Technique that involves removing internal organs and viscera to protect the "
"corpse from rotting from inside.  Yields internal organs.  Carcass will be "
"lighter and will stay fresh longer.  Can be combined with other methods for "
"better effects."
msgstr ""

#: src/game.cpp:9297
msgid "Skin corpse"
msgstr "Dépecer le corps"

#: src/game.cpp:9298
msgid "has no skin"
msgstr "Rien à écorcher"

#: src/game.cpp:9301
msgid ""
"Skinning a corpse is an involved and careful process that usually takes some"
" time.  You need skill and an appropriately sharp and precise knife to do a "
"good job.  Some corpses are too small to yield a full-sized hide and will "
"instead produce scraps that can be used in other ways."
msgstr ""
"Écorcher un cadavre est un processus complexe et minutieux qui prend "
"généralement un certain temps. Vous avez besoin de compétences et d'un "
"couteau bien affûté et précis pour faire du bon travail. Certains cadavres "
"sont trop petits pour donner une peau de taille normale et produiront à la "
"place des restes qui peuvent être utilisés autrement."

#: src/game.cpp:9308
msgid "Bleed corpse"
msgstr "Saigner le corps"

#: src/game.cpp:9309
msgid "has no blood"
msgstr "Aucun sang à saigner"

#: src/game.cpp:9312
msgid ""
"Bleeding involves severing the carotid arteries and jugular veins, or the "
"blood vessels from which they arise.  You need skill and an appropriately "
"sharp and precise knife to do a good job."
msgstr ""

#: src/game.cpp:9318
msgid "Quarter corpse"
msgstr "Couper le cadavre en quartiers"

#: src/game.cpp:9321
msgid ""
"By quartering a previously field dressed corpse you will acquire four parts "
"with reduced weight and volume.  It may help in transporting large game.  "
"This action destroys skin, hide, pelt, etc., so don't use it if you want to "
"harvest them later."
msgstr ""
"En divisant en quatre un corps précédemment habillé sur le terrain, vous "
"obtiendrez quatre parties de poids et de volume réduits. Cela peut aider au "
"transport du gros gibier. Cette action détruit peau, cuir, fourrure, etc., "
"alors ne l'utilisez pas si vous souhaitez les récolter plus tard."

#: src/game.cpp:9328
msgid "Dismember corpse"
msgstr "démembrer le corps"

#: src/game.cpp:9331
msgid ""
"If you're aiming to just destroy a body outright and don't care about "
"harvesting it, dismembering it will hack it apart in a very short amount of "
"time but yields little to no usable flesh."
msgstr ""

#: src/game.cpp:9336
msgid "Dissect corpse"
msgstr "Disséquer le cadavre"

#: src/game.cpp:9339
msgid ""
"By careful dissection of the corpse, you will examine it for possible bionic"
" implants, or discrete organs and harvest them if possible.  Requires "
"scalpel-grade cutting tools, ruins corpse, and consumes a lot of time.  Your"
" medical knowledge is most useful here."
msgstr ""

#: src/game.cpp:9380
msgid "You can't butcher while driving!"
msgstr "Vous ne pouvez pas dépecer en conduisant!"

#: src/game.cpp:9386
msgid "You don't have a butchering tool."
msgstr "Vous n'avez pas d'outil de boucherie."

#: src/game.cpp:9387
msgid "There are no corpses here to butcher."
msgstr "Il n'y a aucun cadavre à dépecer ici."

#: src/game.cpp:9392
msgid "You can't access the items here."
msgstr "Vous ne pouvez pas accéder aux éléments ici."

