#: src/options.cpp:2655
msgid "Size of cities"
msgstr "Dimension des villes"

#: src/options.cpp:2656
msgid ""
"A number determining how large cities are.  A higher number means larger "
"cities.  0 disables cities, roads and any scenario requiring a city start."
msgstr ""

#: src/options.cpp:2660
msgid "City spacing"
msgstr "Espacement des villes"

#: src/options.cpp:2661
msgid ""
"A number determining how far apart cities are.  A higher number means cities"
" are further apart.  Warning, small numbers lead to very slow mapgen."
msgstr ""

#: src/options.cpp:2665
msgid "Spawn rate scaling factor"
msgstr "Taux d'apparition des monstres"

#: src/options.cpp:2666
msgid ""
"A scaling factor that determines density of monster spawns.  A higher number"
" means more monsters."
msgstr ""

#: src/options.cpp:2670
msgid "Item spawn scaling factor"
msgstr "Taux d'apparition des objets"

#: src/options.cpp:2671
msgid ""
"A scaling factor that determines density of item spawns.  A higher number "
"means more items."
msgstr ""

#: src/options.cpp:2675
msgid "Random NPC spawn time"
msgstr ""

#: src/options.cpp:2676
msgid ""
"Baseline average number of days between random NPC spawns.  Average duration"
" goes up with the number of NPCs already spawned.  A higher number means "
"fewer NPCs.  Set to 0 days to disable random NPCs."
msgstr ""

#: src/options.cpp:2681
msgid "Monster evolution scaling factor"
msgstr "Vitesse d'évolution des monstres"

#: src/options.cpp:2682
msgid ""
"A scaling factor that determines the time between monster upgrades.  A "
"higher number means slower evolution.  Set to 0.00 to turn off monster "
"upgrades."
msgstr ""
"Détermine la durée entre chaque évolution des monstres. Plus la valeur est "
"grande plus l'évolution est lente. '0.00' désactive l'évolution."

#: src/options.cpp:2689
msgid "Monster Properties Options"
msgstr ""

#: src/options.cpp:2690
msgid "Options regarding monster properties."
msgstr ""

#: src/options.cpp:2692
msgid "Monster speed"
msgstr "Vitesse des monstres"

#: src/options.cpp:2693
msgid ""
"Determines the movement rate of monsters.  A higher value increases monster "
"speed and a lower reduces it.  Requires world reset."
msgstr ""

#: src/options.cpp:2697
msgid "Monster resilience"
msgstr "Résistance des monstres"

#: src/options.cpp:2698
msgid ""
"Determines how much damage monsters can take.  A higher value makes monsters"
" more resilient and a lower makes them more flimsy.  Requires world reset."
msgstr ""

#: src/options.cpp:2705
msgid "Default region type"
msgstr "Type de région par défaut"

#: src/options.cpp:2706
msgid "(WIP feature) Determines terrain, shops, plants, and more."
msgstr ""
"(fonction en travaux) Détermine le terrain, les magasins, les plantes et "
"autres sur un monde."

#: src/options.cpp:2712
msgid "Spawn Time Options"
msgstr ""

#: src/options.cpp:2713
msgid "Options regarding spawn time."
msgstr ""

#: src/options.cpp:2715
msgid "Season length"
msgstr "Durée des saisons"

#: src/options.cpp:2716
msgid ""
"Season length, in days.  Warning: Very little other than the duration of "
"seasons scales with this value, so adjusting it may cause nonsensical "
"results."
msgstr ""
"Durée des saisons en jour. Avertissement: Pas grand chose dans le jeu est "
"conçu pour s'adapter à ce paramètre, et l'ajuster trop bas ou trop haut "
"pourrait causer des résultats insensés comme de la neige au milieu de l'été."

#: src/options.cpp:2720
msgid "Construction scaling"
msgstr "Vitesse de construction"

#: src/options.cpp:2721
msgid ""
"Sets the time of construction in percents.  '50' is two times faster than "
"default, '200' is two times longer.  '0' automatically scales construction "
"time to match the world's season length."
msgstr ""
"Définit le temps de construction en pourcents. '50' est deux fois plus "
"rapide que la valeur par défaut, '200' est deux fois plus long. '0' définit "
"automatiquement le temps de construction pour correspondre à la longueur "
"d'une saison."

#: src/options.cpp:2725
msgid "Eternal season"
msgstr "Saison éternelle"

#: src/options.cpp:2726
msgid "If true, keep the initial season for ever."
msgstr ""
"En activant cette option vous garderez la saison initiale comme saison "
"éternelle."

#: src/options.cpp:2730
msgid "Day/night cycle"
msgstr "Cycle jour/nuit"

#: src/options.cpp:2731
msgid ""
"Day/night cycle settings.  'Normal' sets a normal cycle.  'Eternal Day' sets"
" eternal day.  'Eternal Night' sets eternal night."
msgstr ""
"Paramètres de cycle jour/nuit. \"Normal\" applique un cycle normal. \"Jour "
"Éternel\" un jour éternel et \"Nuit Éternelle\" une nuit éternelle."

#: src/options.cpp:2733
msgid "Eternal Day"
msgstr "Jour Éternel"

#: src/options.cpp:2734
msgid "Eternal Night"
msgstr "Nuit Éternelle"

#: src/options.cpp:2742
msgid "Miscellaneous options."
msgstr "Options diverses."

#: src/options.cpp:2744
msgid "Wandering hordes"
msgstr "Hordes errantes"

#: src/options.cpp:2745
msgid ""
"If true, emulates zombie hordes.  Zombies can group together into hordes, "
"which can wander around cities and will sometimes move towards noise.  Note:"
" the current implementation does not properly respect obstacles, so hordes "
"can appear to walk through walls under some circumstances.  Must reset world"
" directory after changing for it to take effect."
msgstr ""

#: src/options.cpp:2749
msgid "Surrounded start"
msgstr "Départ encerclé"

#: src/options.cpp:2750
msgid ""
"If true, spawn zombies at shelters.  Makes the starting game a lot harder."
msgstr ""
"Si vrai des zombies sont générés aux abris. Le début est donc beaucoup plus "
"difficile."

#: src/options.cpp:2757
msgid "Mutations by radiation"
msgstr "Mutations par radiation"

#: src/options.cpp:2758
msgid "If true, radiation causes the player to mutate."
msgstr "Si vrai, les radiations entrainent la mutation du joueur."

#: src/options.cpp:2764
